<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S4" title="In ELEC: Efficient Large Language Model-Empowered Click-Through Rate Prediction" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4 </span>Related Work</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S5" title="In ELEC: Efficient Large Language Model-Empowered Click-Through Rate Prediction" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5 </span>Conclusion</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_bibliography"><a href="#bib" title="In ELEC: Efficient Large Language Model-Empowered Click-Through Rate Prediction" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">References</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
