<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line ltx_leqno">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">ELEC: Efficient Large Language Model-Empowered Click-Through Rate Prediction</h1>
<span class="ltx_pubnotes ltx_pubnotes_meta"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_conference"><span class="ltx_note_name">Conference: </span>Proceedings of the 48th International ACM SIGIR Conference on Research and Development in Information Retrieval; July 13–18, 2025; Padua, Italy</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_booktitle">Proceedings of the 48th International ACM SIGIR Conference on Research and Development in Information Retrieval (SIGIR ’25), July 13–18, 2025, Padua, Italy</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_doi"><span class="ltx_note_name">DOI: </span><a href="https://doi.org/10.1145/3726302.3730188">10.1145/3726302.3730188</a></span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_isbn"><span class="ltx_note_name">ISBN: </span>979-8-4007-1592-1/2025/07</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_ccs"><span class="ltx_note_name">CCS: </span>Information systems Online advertising</span></span></span>
