<figure id="S3.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2. </span>Test results on experimental datasets. The best result is in bold font. A small improvement in AUC (e.g., 0.0020) can lead to a significant increase in online CTR (e.g., 3%) <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib3" title="" class="ltx_ref">Cheng et al., 2016</a>)</cite>. * indicates the statistical significance for <math id="S3.T2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p\leq 0.01" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>0.01</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p\leq 0.01</annotation></semantics></math> compared with the second best result over paired t-test.</figcaption>
